{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2021-10-14 06:30:00', 'title': 'TRIMBLE INTRODUCES CONNECTED MODEL-BASED ESTIMATING WORKFLOW FOR MECHANICAL PIPING AND ELECTRICAL CONTRACTORS', 'text': 'SUNNYVALE, CALIF., OCT. 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TRIMBLE (NASDAQ: TRMB) INTRODUCED TODAY ITS MODEL-BASED ESTIMATING WORKFLOW, WHICH SEAMLESSLY CONNECTS THE BUILDING INFORMATION MODEL (BIM) TO THE ESTIMATE FOR MECHANICAL PIPING AND ELECTRICAL CONTRACTORS.'}